obulated adipose tissue with focal areas of scant tan white rubbery  focally nodular  fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative mass in relation to anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative mass in relation to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative mass   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative skin at site of puckering   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative away  upper outer quadrant  at 10 o clock position   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative uninvolved  lower outer quadrant  at 7 o clock position   Received fresh  labeled  right breast final inferior deep margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fragment of yellow red fibroadipose tissue  received with 2 sutures denoting the final margin  The stitched aspect is inked in black  specimen is serially sectioned and representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  right mastectomy flap   are 2 irregular portions of wrinkled white skin  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  No masses or lesions are identified  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday August 04   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 11 59PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART B  Breast  Right  Final Inferior Deep Margin   Excision PART C  Skin  Right Mastectomy Flap   Excision  report_end  , No.
